<title>USA: H&amp;R Block unit files $1 bln shelf offer.</title>
<headline>H&amp;R Block unit files $1 bln shelf offer.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Block Financial Corp, a financial services unit of H&amp;R Block Inc, filed Thursday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $1 billion in guaranteed debt securities.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes, which may include future acquisitions.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
